  "summary": "Installs the hidden headlamp housing (rotating headlamp bucket, LH/RH) and its support in the front fender: the support is screwed down at four points to the headlamp opening support / front fender upper panel, the housing pivots on it, the actuator rod attaches to the housing lever with a screw and bushing, and an adjusting screw with jam nut in a stop sets the fully-open position. Also covers the headlamp shield (LH/RH). Clevis adjustment on sheet A2 comes first.",
